R"VG(
# hunt.vg (H-04's second pass): the hunt, painted or cut: the wall, the hunters (each people's own weapons, its own way of
# drawing a hunter, its own rites over the kill), the beast, what else is on the wall, and the year the hunt was painted for (`@event
# beasts pre.huntev`: the great one taken, the one that killed, the year the herds did not come).

genre.hunt (words=28..141)
  {hunt.wall} {hunt.figures} {hunt.beast} {hunt.more} {hunt.end}
  {hunt.wall} {hunt.beast} {hunt.figures} {hunt.end}
  {hunt.wall} {hunt.figures} {hunt.beast} {hunt.detail} {hunt.end}
  (2) {hunt.wall} {@event beasts pre.huntev 6} {hunt.figures} {hunt.more} {hunt.end}
  {hunt.wall} {hunt.detail} {hunt.figures} {hunt.beast} {hunt.end}

hunt.wall (formula)
  (medium=painted) {pre.wall.where}, in {pre.paint}, a hunt.
  (medium=painted) {pre.wall.where}: a hunt, in {pre.paint}.
  (medium=stone) Cut into {pre.stone.where}, the lines filled with {colour.holy}: hunters.
  (medium=stone) Pecked into {pre.stone.where}, a hunt.
  (medium=bone) A hunt, cut small along a {pre.bone}.
  (medium=bone) Along a {pre.bone}, cut very fine, a hunt.

pre.wall.where (people=4)
  On the wall of the shelter above {$home}
  Painted low on the rock, where the light reaches at evening
  High on the wall, where it must have been painted from a ledge
  Deep in the cave behind {$home}, where no daylight reaches
  On the overhang by {watersrc}
  (has:$home.landmark) On the rock at {$home.landmark}
  On the ceiling of the shelter
  Along the passage into the cave, at the height of a child's eyes
  On a smooth face of rock above the camp
  Round a bulge in the rock that the painter made the beast's belly
pre.stone.where (people=3)
  a boulder by the path
  the flat rock above {$home}
  a stone by {watersrc}
  the face of a standing stone
  a slab set by the door of {house.one}
  a rock in the middle of {river}, reached at low water
pre.paint (people=2)
  red and black
  (accent!=black) {colour.holy} and black
  ochre and soot
  {colour.holy} alone
  white clay and charcoal
  three colours, the {colour.holy} brightest

# ---- the hunters ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

hunt.figures
  {hunt.who} {hunt.doing}{hunt.where}. {hunt.sign}
  {hunt.who} {hunt.doing}{hunt.where}. {hunt.sign}
  {hunt.who} {hunt.doing}{hunt.where}.
  {hunt.who} {hunt.doing}. {hunt.look2}
hunt.who
  {n} hunters with {pre.weapon},
  {n} hunters {pre.look},
  A line of hunters {pre.look}, {nbig} or more,
  Two hunters only, with {pre.weapon} and a dog between them,
  {n} hunters with {pre.weapon}, {pre.look},
  {n} hunters {pre.look}, one larger than the rest,
  A single hunter with {pre.weapon}, very small, under the belly of the beast,
  {n} hunters with {pre.weapon} and as many dogs,
  {n} hunters {pre.look}, the last of them a child,
hunt.doing
  running
  kneeling, their weapons ready
  closing in from both sides
  driving the beasts toward a cliff edge
  waiting in the reeds
  crossing {river} on a fallen tree
  following the tracks, bent low
  creeping up behind a screen of branches
  calling, their hands to their mouths
  lying flat in the grass
  throwing all at once
  waving firebrands
  (cold=1) running on the ice
  (cold=1) on snowshoes, in a line
  (coast=1) wading along the shore
  (desert=1) crouched among the dunes
  (desert=0) under the {tree}
hunt.where
  (3)
  {pre.where.hunt}
pre.where.hunt (people=4)
  \ under {mountain}
  \ through {land}
  \ in {weather.now}
  \ among the {tree}
  \ by {river}
  \ at the edge of the camp
  \ in {season.now}
  \ along the ridge

pre.weapon (pl people=3)
  spears
  bows
  slings
  nets strung between them
  throwing sticks
  clubs
  darts
  long poles
  firebrands
  snares
  stone-tipped spears
  (coast=1) harpoons
  (cold=1) lances

pre.look (people=2)
  with masks of the {game.one}
  with feathers in their hair
  with tails, as if they were beasts too
  painted half {colour.holy}
  drawn as sticks
  with their legs very long
  with the sign of {$home} on their chests
  wrapped in {garment.n:pl}
  with their hair tied high
  with {motif.over} on their bodies
  with horns on their heads
  with their eyes drawn very large

hunt.look2
  Every hunter has {motif.over} drawn on the arm in {colour.holy}.
  The hunters are drawn without faces; the {game} have faces.
  The hunters' feet are not drawn at all; they seem to float over {land}.
  The first hunter wears the {game.one}'s skin, head and all.
  (accent!=black) The hunters are drawn in {colour.holy}, the {game} in black.
  Each hunter has a line from the mouth: calling, or singing to the {game}.
  The hunters are all the same size except one, who is twice as tall and carries {pre.weapon}.
  The hunters' {pre.weapon} are drawn longer than the hunters.

hunt.sign
  (has:$ruler) Over the {pre.ahead}, in {colour.holy}, the sign that stands for {$ruler:name}.
  Over them, {$home}'s sign in {colour.holy}, {pre.signrep}.
  The sign over them, in {colour.holy}, is the same as on the {pre.signed} from {$home}{pre.signed.tail}.
  Each has a sign of its own over the head, in {colour.holy}; the ship keeps them as names{pre.unread}.
  (has:$f) Over the first of them, in {colour.holy}, the sign of {$f:name}, {pre.f.seen}.
  The sign of {$home} is drawn on every {pre.weapon.one}, {pre.signrep}.
pre.ahead
  large one
  first hunter
  one in front
  one with the longest {pre.weapon.one}
pre.signrep
  once
  twice
  repeated down the line
  fainter than the rest
  inside a ring of {pre.stroke}
pre.unread
  (2)
  , unread
  \ it cannot read
  , for now
pre.f.seen
  who is on other {pre.signed} too
  who is on the {pre.signed} too
  drawn inside {motif.over}
  (has:$home.landmark) the same as on the rock at {$home.landmark}
pre.signed
  bones
  pots
  stones
  {vessel}
  spear shafts
pre.signed.tail
  (2)
  , but larger
  , turned on its side
  , cut twice

# ---- the beast --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

hunt.beast
  {hunt.beast.a} {hunt.beast.b}
  {hunt.beast.a} {hunt.beast.b}
  (cold=1) The {game} in snow, {pre.snow.drawn}.
  (desert=1) The {game} at the dry pool, {pre.dry.drawn}.
pre.snow.drawn
  drawn as dots round their legs
  floundering, and the hunters gaining on them
  with the {bird} following over them
  drawn white on {colour.holy}, the snow left bare
  sunk to the belly, the hunters with {pre.weapon} on snowshoes behind them
  their breath drawn as lines in front of them
  the snow drawn as a white band the {colour.holy} hunters cross
pre.dry.drawn
  drawn with their heads down, drinking
  the water drawn as a single ring in {colour.holy}
  the hunters lying flat behind the dunes
  drawn at night, with {skynight} over them
hunt.beast.a
  Before them, a great {game.one}
  Before them, {n} {game} {=.many}
  Ahead, a {game.one}
  (medium=painted) At the edge of the wall, a {game.one}
  (medium!=painted) At the end, a {game.one}
  Over them all, a {game.one} drawn twice their size,
  In the middle, a {game.one}
  Coming down the slope, {n} {game} {=.many}
  Across the whole {pre.bone.or}, the {game} {=.many}
  Alone at the top, a {game.one}
# the beast's state, one or many (`.many`)
hunt.beast.b
  (!has:.many) with arrows in its side.
  (.many=1) with arrows in their sides.
  (medium=painted) painted on top of older ones.
  (medium!=painted) cut over older ones.
  (!has:.many) fallen, its legs up; the hunters' hands are raised.
  (.many=1) , one of them fallen, its legs up; the hunters' hands are raised.
  drinking at the water, not yet seen.
  (!has:.many) turned at bay, its head down; one hunter is already on the ground.
  (.many=1) turned at bay, their heads down; one hunter is already on the ground.
  (!has:.many) running, its legs drawn many times to show it.
  (.many=1) running, their legs drawn many times to show it.
  (!has:.many) with its young behind it, which the hunters do not touch.
  (.many=1) with their young among them, which the hunters do not touch.
  (!has:.many) looking back over its shoulder at the hunters.
  (.many=1) looking back over their shoulders at the hunters.
  (!has:.many) drawn with its heart showing, a red mark inside the outline.
  (!has:.many) with a {pre.weapon.one} hanging from it.
  (.many=1) going over the edge, one after another.

# ---- what else is on the wall -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

hunt.more
  (once medium=painted) [Under it|Around it|Beside the beast], hands pressed to the rock in {colour.holy}: {n}.
  (once) Behind them, a [woman|man|girl] {pre.fig.dress} holds up a child to see the {game.one}.
  (once) A fire of {fuel} burns at the side, and figures round it with their arms [up|linked|out].
  (once moons>0) Above it all, {moon}, drawn as {pre.moon.drawn}.
  (once) A figure walks away from the hunt, carrying {pre.carry.thing}, {pre.carry.how}.
  (once) A figure with {instrument} stands behind them, and lines run from it to the beast: the calling, perhaps.
  (4 once contact=1) At the edge, figures drawn thinner and taller than the hunters: the {other}, watching.
  (once) {pre.hunt.rite}
  (once) {pre.hunt.rite}
pre.moon.drawn
  a half circle over {land}
  a circle with {motif.over} in it
  a ring with a {colour.holy} dot
  a crescent lying on its back
  a circle of {pre.stroke}
pre.carry.thing
  {vessel.one}
  {tool}
  a child
  the {game.one}'s head
  a bundle of {material}
pre.carry.how
  very carefully
  at a run
  looking back
  and the ship cannot tell why
pre.hunt.rite (people=4)
  One hunter kneels by the fallen beast and touches its head: the thanks, perhaps.
  The beast's heart is drawn outside it, held up toward {skyone}.
  A figure stands apart with {instrument}: the one who calls the beasts.
  A dog is drawn as large as a hunter, with a sign of its own over it.
  The {game.one}'s meat is drawn divided into {#number} parts, one of them very small, for {god}.
  Every hunter carries a small bag at the hip; the {~charm}, perhaps.
  A figure with the {game.one}'s horns on its head dances in front of the hunters.
  The first beast's blood is drawn running into {vessel.one}, and a figure holds it up to {god}.
  Behind the hunters, a line of figures carries the {game.one} home on poles, toward {houses}.
  The {game.one}'s skull is drawn hung on a post by the camp.
  A child is given the first piece; the child is drawn holding it up.
  The hunters are drawn again at the bottom, washing in {river}.
  The hunters' faces are smeared with the {game.one}'s blood, drawn in {colour.holy}.
  A figure counts the hunters back in, with a {pre.stroke.one} for each one.
  The bones of the {game.one} are drawn laid out in a row, every one, for {god}.
  One hunter is drawn giving the skin to an old woman with {tool}.
  The hunters sit in a ring and a {vessel.one.n} goes round: {drink}, perhaps.
  A small fire is drawn where the {game.one} fell, and smoke going up to {skyone}.
  The best hunter is drawn with the {game.one}'s tail tied at the waist.
  The {game.one}'s eyes are covered with a hand: so it will not see who took it, perhaps.
pre.stroke.one
  notch
  stroke
  dot
  mark

hunt.detail
  Behind them, {land}, drawn as {pre.land.drawn}.
  {pre.wx.marks} across the top of the {pre.bone.or}: the hunt was in {season.now}.
  The {bird} are drawn over the hunt, {pre.bird.do}.
  At the bottom, the camp: {houses}, drawn as {pre.hut.drawn}.
  A line of {pre.track} in {colour.holy} runs the length of the {pre.bone.or}, older than the {game} over it.
  The hunters' dogs, {pre.dog.look}, are drawn alone at one end, {pre.dogs.do}.
  A river runs along the bottom of the {pre.bone.or}, the beasts on one side and the hunters on the other, {pre.river.cross}.
  (medium=painted) The wall slopes, and the painter made the slope the {pre.slope} the beasts are running down.
  In a corner, a small hunter in {colour.holy} sits apart with a broken {pre.weapon.one}.
  (accent!=black) The {game} are thick and careful, {colour.holy} over black; the hunters were done {pre.fast}.
  The {game} are cut deep and the hunters only scratched, as if the {game} mattered more.
  The {tree} are drawn behind the hunters as {pre.tree.drawn}.
  A {beast} is drawn among the hunters, following them like one of them.
pre.land.drawn
  a row of humps
  long lines
  a jagged edge
  dots
  a line of teeth
pre.wx.marks
  (cold=1) Snow marks
  (cold=1) Flakes
  Dots like rain
  Long lines like wind
  A sun with rays
  (desert=1) Brown smears like dust
pre.bird.do
  following it
  waiting
  circling over the fallen beast
  flying the other way
pre.hut.drawn
  small marks with smoke over them
  circles with a dot in each
  little humps
  triangles in a row
pre.track
  tracks
  hoofprints
  footprints
  dots and dashes
pre.fast
  fast
  in a hurry, by another hand
  quickly, the legs only lines
pre.dog.look (people=2)
  spotted
  with curled tails
  drawn as big as calves
  with collars of {colour.holy}
  lean and long-legged
  with their ears up
pre.dogs.do
  lying down, done
  still running
  fighting over a bone
  with their tongues out
pre.river.cross
  and only one hunter has crossed
  and a fallen tree between them
  and nobody has crossed yet
pre.slope
  hill
  bank
  ridge
  cliff
pre.tree.drawn
  straight lines with branches like hands
  tufts
  spikes
  circles on sticks

hunt.end
  (medium=painted) {wall.state}
  (medium=painted) {wall.state}
  (medium=stone) {stone.state}
  (medium=bone) {obj.state}
  {hunt.later}
